Z||000002||cifc||07-27-2000||11:15 PM||||I believe the rockford sub needs .35 cubic feet of airspace.  If my math is right thats about 605 cubic inches. I think the volume of a cylinder is 3.14 x radius(4) squared x l.  Please tell me if that is wrong.  Anyway, I came up with about 12.1 inches.<BR>--Jason||||reg||1
